      "description": "The intaglio-green hero note with engraved frame, serial and denomination.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-note\"><div class=\"ds-note-f1\"></div><div class=\"ds-note-f2\"></div><div class=\"ds-note-top\"><span>Rank 2 · ETH</span><span class=\"ds-note-ser\">CZ 002 0519</span></div><p class=\"ds-note-den\">$2,358</p><div class=\"ds-note-mp\">ETHEREUM · ETH · RANK 2 · CRYPTOZONE · ETHEREUM · ETH · RANK 2 · CRYPTOZONE · ETHEREUM · ETH · RANK 2 · CRYPTOZONE</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-note{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:520px;padding:28px 40px 0;border-radius:14px;background:rgb(var(--note));color:rgb(var(--note-ink));font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgb(var(--shadow)/.12),0 12px 32px -12px rgb(var(--shadow)/.35)}.ds-note-f1{position:absolute;inset:8px;border:1px solid rgb(var(--note-ink)/.15);border-radius:10px;pointer-events:none}.ds-note-f2{position:absolute;inset:13px;border:1px solid rgb(var(--note-ink)/.10);border-radius:7px;pointer-events:none}.ds-note-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 85;color:rgb(var(--note-dim))}.ds-note-ser{color:rgb(var(--note-serial))}.ds-note-den{margin:32px 0;font-size:72px;line-height:.9;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-stretch:125%;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 125;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-note-mp{margin:0 -40px;padding:10px 40px;border-top:1px solid rgb(var(--note-ink)/.15);font-size:5.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;color:rgb(var(--note-dim)/.7)}"
